<Base title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for bendichter.com.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p>
    This is a static personal website. It sets no cookies, runs no analytics, serves
    no advertising, and has no comment system, contact form, or mailing list. There is
    nothing here that collects information about you.
  </p>

  <p>
    The site is hosted on <a href="https://pages.github.com/">GitHub Pages</a>. GitHub
    records standard server logs for the requests it serves, which is outside my
    control. Their handling of that data is described in the{" "}
    <a
      href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement"
      >GitHub Privacy Statement</a
    >.
  </p>

  <p>
    Video thumbnails on the talks page and the homepage are copies served from this
    site, not embeds, so nothing is requested from YouTube until you click through to
    a video. Individual talk pages do embed the video itself, using
    youtube-nocookie.com. Once a video plays, or once you follow any link off this
    site, that third party's own privacy practices apply.
  </p>

  <p>If you email me, I will use your address to reply to you and nothing else.</p>

  <p>
    Questions about any of this are welcome at{" "}
    <a href="mailto:ben.dichter@catalystneuro.com">ben.dichter@catalystneuro.com</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
